<title>FRANCE: Elf up after Girassol field presentation.</title>
<headline>Elf up after Girassol field presentation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Elf Aquitaine rose against the trend on Friday after the energy group made presentations to analysts on the Girassol field off the coast of Angola and said it had great potential, brokers said.</p>
<p>Elf said the field had promising reserves and added that there were other &quot;potential discoveries&quot; in the area, said analyst David Cline at Paribas.</p>
<p>The stock was up 0.72 percent at 563 francs at 1250 GMT while the Paris bourse's stock was 1.22 percent weaker.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
